{"unit_id":"sailoumili__dsh-file-opener#card-zh","repo":"sailoumili/dsh-file-opener","commit":"3ef8fa42df9bc3bfa8a90fdaf710982b9892286f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-opener（DSH 插件，Web 与桌面客户端）：把对话中的文件和目录路径变成可点击入口。它在浏览器端增强行内路径和官方文件按钮，并由宿主端查询路径、判断文件类型及打开目标。点击文件时，可预览的内容进入右侧侧边栏，其余可交给系统默认程序；目录和文件夹图标可打开目录，按住 Shift 可强制使用系统程序。适合需要从 DSH 对话快速查看或定位本机文件的用户。Windows 上可直接用资源管理器或默认程序打开；无需额外密钥或账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:538-568","lib/index.js:442-522"]}
{"unit_id":"sailoumili__dsh-file-opener#card-en","repo":"sailoumili/dsh-file-opener","commit":"3ef8fa42df9bc3bfa8a90fdaf710982b9892286f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-file-opener makes DSH file paths clickable. Previewable files open in the right sidebar; others use the system app. Folder icons open directories, and Shift-click forces system opening. It helps users access local files from chat. Windows supports direct opening; no key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:538-568","lib/index.js:442-522"]}
